{"title":"1996 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When Walter drove up to the gasoline pump, he noticed that his gasoline tank was 1/8 full.  He purchased 7.5 gallons of gasoline for 10 dollars.  With this additional gasoline, his gasoline tank was then 5/8 full.  The number of gallons of gasoline his tank holds when it is full is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/8/b98a2bef1e72f71122ef27aefe90e6b75fb4497d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 8.75 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 11.5 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 22.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"418\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The tank started at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5db9e227e8177d26de452c2a2faeb6d45cc53d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> full, and ended at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f4344e4ce1c2a266b885d9b160544e3036de15f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> full.  Therefore, Walter filled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/b/4fb6c676a6ee1f949a43e7b0721d8609beab0e55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{8} - \\frac{1}{8} = \\frac{4}{8} = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"121\" height=\"37\" /> of the tank.\n</p><p>If Walter fills half the tank with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/0548d22c8d43aa7314709ed34e7c106d4057beb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> gallons, then Walter can fill two halves of the tank (or a whole tank) with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/7/5074c8c6aff656537e709a143e0293924ae872e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.5 \\times 2 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"96\" height=\"13\" /> gallons, giving an answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME\" title=\"1996 AJHSME\">1996 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1996 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1996\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AJHSM